            "detailed_description": "Saudi Arabia, one of the world's leading oil suppliers and a key U.S. ally, has been taken over by a highly organized group of radical terrorists. The government is in a state of collapse and turmoil and you have been chosen to lead the United States' armed forces to restore control.<br>\t\t\t\t\tSearch and destroy using the latest military hardware from the Abrams tank to the Apache helicopter in realistic settings ranging from the open desert to close-quarters infantry combat. Wear down enemy morale by capturing vehicles, weapons and buildings.  You'll need elite forces to destroy the world's best-armed fanatics, bent on world-wide economic collapse.  The soldiers who survive will gain experience and move with you from mission to mission. <br>\t\t\t\t\tFailure is not an option — This is Warfare.<br>\t\t\t\t\tKey features:<br>\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fight with the latest U.S. &amp; Russian Weapons Systems<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Dominate real territories created from satellite images<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Gain experience for your troops by keeping them alive<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Capture Enemy vehicles and weaponry<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Destroy everything in your path with realistic physics<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Shock and Awe your opponents to wear down their morale<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Hone your tactics in various environments from open desert to urban combat<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>12 missions for the USA army expeditionary corps<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul>",
